y-id "q-7835" :question/problem "Which of the following are square matrices?\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$K=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $K$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $2$ rows and $3$ columns, so it's a $2\\times 3$ matrix.\n\n- $L$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $2$ rows and $2$ columns, so it is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\n- $M$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $4$ rows and $4$ columns, so it is a $4\\times 4$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, only $L$ and $M$ are square matrices."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400205 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4c4b6f3-a9d9-5370-8991-9303e65c3015" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472550} {:answer/id #uuid "d564422c-47a5-5ab6-8593-71deb3c3cd69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472551}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472550} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b5d220c-18b5-57e7-a90d-58d07571e262" :answer-field/key "P" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473670} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8657c195-208d-54ba-8639-f23613e3b183" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472552} {:answer/id #uuid "9a555d27-4f3f-5c78-ba86-d3dbf70f47af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472553}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/