begin{bmatrix}-1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- $A$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $1$ row and $1$ column, so it is a $1\\times 1$ matrix.\n\n- $B$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $3$ rows and $3$ columns, so it is a $3\\times 3$ matrix.\n\n- $C$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $1$ row and $2$ columns, so it's a $1\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, only $A$ and $B$ are square matrices."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400219 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "778e7dac-5d43-5278-8a2c-8d400611b7e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472562} {:answer/id #uuid "6090d412-485e-50cf-bfc7-d6f5ce1710e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472563}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472562} :answer-field/id #uuid "254f4622-91f2-53e1-9ca7-228a6b89a866" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473676} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6e6e0ca1-4931-5c90-b1e8-b3f10d94782b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472564} {:answer/id #uuid "6ad8d633-8913-57ff-81b6-ff6ed7cda5ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472565}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472565} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb175dfe-5424-5925-87ac-fcfcfe4f1ee9" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-fi