0$).\n\n- $C$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $A$ and $C$ are zero matrices."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530579 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2cb42f95-4419-5a51-91ab-4d7c28e0f3b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530573} {:answer/id #uuid "7437b57a-2a12-5152-9852-a33567178cc2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530575} {:answer/id #uuid "8dcd8fd2-48c4-5255-ac9e-25c877fc43cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530576} {:answer/id #uuid "a7c30caf-49b4-5ea7-aa58-b33e1e633129" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k=6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530577} {:answer/id #uuid "b571ca6d-4ec5-50fd-8827-bb0c6a423d56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530578}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "k=6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530577} :answer-field/id #uuid "71c0ea85-8283-576a-8299-6ae94d64a63b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530574}] :question/id #uuid "f16bbe6e-f1a6-54a1-bc2e-dc02da0cf210" :question/problem "If \n\n$$\nkA=\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & -54 & 60\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n,\nwhere \n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nand $k$ is a scalar, calculate the value of $k.$" :question/worked-solution "To express $kA,$ we multiply each entry of $A$ by $k,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}kA & =k\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 k & - 9 k & 10 k\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set the above result equal to the matrix given for $kA$ in the problem statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 k & - 9 k & 10 k\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & -54 & 60\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWe can solve for $k$ by equating any two corresponding (nonzero) elements. Let's choose the elements in row $1$ and column $2$, $- 9 k$ and $-54.$ Equating these elements, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}- 9 k & =-54 \\\\ k & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Note:** We would still get the same result if we chose any other two corresponding (nonzero) elements."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539208 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "411d88e5-d8e0-59e2-9232-75d02c67dc6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539226} {:answer/id #uuid "6a95c24c-3950-52f9-95dc-6fd2562407a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{9}{25} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{3}{10} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539237} {:answer/id #uuid "71cd9849-777d-523c-9920-ab59ee979d28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{9}{25} & \\frac{3}{4} & - \\frac{3}{10} \\\\ - \\frac{3}{20} & \\frac{3}{4} & - \\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539238} {:answer/id #uuid "7740c74d-1463-597d-bf77-c2d951ee04de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{3}{20} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539240} {:answer/id #uuid "adc7ef85-066e-57d2-bc6e-07c756c579dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{9}{25} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{3}{10} \\\\ \\frac{3}{20} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539254}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{9}{25} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{3}{10} \\\\ \\frac{3}{20} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539254} :answer-field/id #uuid "2839558c-d69e-56b6-8b69-294e6e1bcbdd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539217}] :question/id #uuid "0f659e07-3f29-5ded-a2f0-97340015a2b4" :question/problem "Calculate $- \\frac{3}{5}A$, if \n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $A$ by $- \\frac{3}{5},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{3}{5}A & =- \\frac{3}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}(- \\frac{3}{5})\\cdot \\frac{3}{5} & (- \\frac{3}{5})\\cdot \\frac{5}{4} & (- \\frac{3}{5})\\cdot (- \\frac{1}{2}) \\\\ (- \\frac{3}{5})\\cdot (- \\frac{1}{4}) & (- \\frac{3}{5})\\cdot \\frac{5}{4} & (- \\frac{3}{5})\\cdot (- \\frac{2}{3})\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{9}{25} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{3}{10} \\\\ \\frac{3}{20} & - \\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539210 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6460331c-c171-5546-876c-c5f4739e5456" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{3}{16} & - \\frac{3}{5} \\\\ \\frac{15}{8} & \\frac{3}{20} \\\\ 1 & - \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539236} {:answer/id #uuid "a9d7ee57-7f32-5c4a-90ae-e139e27f6c63" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{16} & \\frac{3}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{15}{8} & - \\frac{3}{20} \\\\ \\frac{4}{3} & - \\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539251} {:answer/id #uuid "bb80dd4b-cd57-587e-830a-08e988d3f237" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{1}{4} & - \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{15}{8} & - \\frac{3}{20} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539257} {:answer/id #uuid "c70658a6-45e6-505f-873a-a19694163643" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{1}{4} & - \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2} & \\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{3} & - \\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539260} {:answer/id #uuid "cf6617ad-adcb-55b3-ba30-ee7ee2cc0709" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{16} & \\frac{3}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{15}{8} & - \\frac{3}{20} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539264}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{16} & \\frac{3}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{15}{8} & - \\frac{3}{20} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539264} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3e6d40d-b87f-5e4c-992b-12ad9e8d14fc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539276}] :question/id #uuid "13cd57df-c3b1-5b4f-8c75-e0bfe62d3d36" :question/problem "$$\n- \\frac{3}{4}\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{1}{4} & - \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2} & \\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{3} & - \\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of the matrix by $- \\frac{3}{4}$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{3}{4}\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{1}{4} & - \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2} & \\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{3} & - \\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(- \\frac{3}{4})\\cdot (- \\frac{1}{4}) & (- \\frac{3}{4})\\cdot (- \\frac{4}{5}) \\\\ (- \\frac{3}{4})\\cdot \\frac{5}{2} & (- \\frac{3}{4})\\cdot \\frac{1}{5} \\\\ (- \\frac{3}{4})\\cdot \\frac{4}{3} & (- \\frac{3}{4})\\cdot (- \\frac{4}{5})\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{16} & \\frac{3}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{15}{8} & - \\frac{3}{20} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539222 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "40736c8e-c7ae-59bc-82a9-8209d177f625" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & -1 \\\\ 12 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539225} {:answer/id #uuid "7de292de-e463-55ae-a8ba-3e76bb64cabe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 4 \\\\ -12 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539243} {:answer/id #uuid "85d5b95e-596e-5a44-9a43-75e40eb86ea7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 4 \\\\ 12 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539246} {:answer/id #uuid "a218ec4a-d1f8-5b0f-9ca3-ee58c2f6dc18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 4 \\\\ 12 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539250} {:answer/id #uuid "f9f86529-cb6d-584d-a80f-68afe06684a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539279}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 4 \\\\ 12 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539250} :answer-field/id #uuid "4dfb2d42-0b02-5ae5-87f7-7747faa731bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539231}] :question/id #uuid "3d958cb5-b318-5cf0-9391-9bcf871125e9" :question/problem "$$\n-4\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -1 \\\\ -3 & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of the matrix by $-4$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -1 \\\\ -3 & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-4)\\cdot (-4) & (-4)\\cdot (-1) \\\\ (-4)\\cdot (-3) & (-4)\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 4 \\\\ 12 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539223 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "819bff75-2465-5e11-b3ee-9b21fa64c0d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{8}{25} & -1 & \\frac{4}{15} \\\\ \\frac{2}{25} & \\frac{3}{10} & \\frac{1}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539245} {:answer/id #uuid "c8e7ef70-383d-5735-b381-07b71bbbad87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{5}{2} & - \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{5} & - \\frac{3}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539261} {:answer/id #uuid "ef597349-478e-5ace-a0b5-d0dcd2304539" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{8}{25} & 1 & - \\frac{4}{15} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{5} & - \\frac{3}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539274} {:answer/id #uuid "f62ddb38-96a6-540c-ab19-fe0e2b2260d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{5}{2} & - \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{25} & - \\frac{3}{10} & - \\frac{1}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539277} {:answer/id #uuid "f9fcf54f-c8d7-5b5b-8bc1-7b0c96837c0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{8}{25} & 1 & - \\frac{4}{15} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{25} & - \\frac{3}{10} & - \\frac{1}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539280}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{8}{25} & 1 & - \\frac{4}{15} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{25} & - \\frac{3}{10} & - \\frac{1}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539280} :answer-field/id #uuid "58f238b7-52bf-5573-a34a-4b51c282e839" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539233}] :question/id #uuid "3e055066-78c5-5a46-892f-8c8e56fa65e9" :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{2}{5}D$, if \n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{5}{2} & - \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{5} & - \\frac{3}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $D$ by $\\frac{2}{5},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{5}D & =\\frac{2}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{5}{2} & - \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{5} & - \\frac{3}{4} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot (- \\frac{4}{5}) & \\frac{2}{5}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2} & \\frac{2}{5}\\cdot (- \\frac{2}{3}) \\\\ \\frac{2}{5}\\cdot (- \\frac{1}{5}) & \\frac{2}{5}\\cdot (- \\frac{3}{4}) & \\frac{2}{5}\\cdot (- \\frac{1}{2})\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{8}{25} & 1 & - \\frac{4}{15} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{25} & - \\frac{3}{10} & - \\frac{1}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539227 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12fb7972-8503-5300-895f-e4330bf6ef81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ -4 & -3 & - \\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539209} {:answer/id #uuid "1e03aeb3-d250-58df-b165-24842f97a9ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & - \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 8 & 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539214} {:answer/id #uuid "336e8f05-e277-5c3c-9111-a13a64a438a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ 8 & 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539219} {:answer/id #uuid "5bb7b4ee-06d7-596c-8498-898f8580bd55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & \\frac{3}{2} & - \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 4 & 3 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539234} {:answer/id #uuid "fd6325e7-0ae0-5355-a22b-3f6fdf509262" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & - \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -4 & -3 & - \\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539281}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & - \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -4 & -3 & - \\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539281} :answer-field/id #uuid "aaa7076d-bace-560a-9951-aeabbc4f7941" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539253}] :question/id #uuid "449837e6-ea9f-50a8-a4de-05520881de50" :question/problem "Calculate $- \\frac{1}{2}D$, if \n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ 8 & 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $D$ by $- \\frac{1}{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{1}{2}D & =- \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ 8 & 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}(- \\frac{1}{2})\\cdot (-4) & (- \\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 3 & (- \\frac{1}{2})\\cdot (-7) \\\\ (- \\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 8 & (- \\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 6 & (- \\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & - \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -4 & -3 & - \\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
